# Repository guidance

## Source of truth

Read and treat these paths as authoritative before doing agent work:

- `.agent-code/config.json`
- `.agent-code/registry/agents.json`
- `.agent-code/registry/skills.json`
- `.agent-code/prompts/`
- `.agent-code/contracts/`
- `.agent-code/templates/`
- `.agent-code/standards/`
- `.agent-cli/`

Generated runtime files are adapters, not the source of truth:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `.agents/skills/*`
- `.cursor/agents/*`
- `.cursor/rules/*`
- `.codex/agents/*`
- `.codex/config.toml`

